There are five pointers embedded there. I could work a conversion of this to structures, but I had a better idea. My Am29000 C compiler is an evolution of this same compiler, and I had replaced already these ugly definitions with elegant structs. So I could do a backport, this means I took more recent code and fitted it into an old code.
